---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="box skills">
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="code" color="#48769e" size="2.5rem" />
		<h2>Data-driven Analysis</h2>
		<p>I work hands-on with the full analytics pipeline: extracting and cleaning data with SQL and Python, then turning it into dashboards and KPI frameworks with Power BI and Tableau. From exploratory analysis to executive-ready reporting, I build the clear, reliable evidence leadership needs to make decisions. And because I design these frameworks with governance in mind, the numbers stay traceable, consistent, and honest about their limits.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="strategy" color="#48769e" size="2.5rem" />
		<h2>Data Governance<br />& AI Ethics</h2>
		<p>I work with the regulatory frameworks that shape how organisations handle data and AI responsibly: EU AI Act, GDPR, FRIA, and human rights-based approaches to bias detection, privacy risks, and ethical impact assessments. My background in Human Rights Law gives this work a foundation that goes beyond compliance. I understand what these frameworks are actually protecting.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="microphone-stage" color="#48769e" size="2.5rem" />
		<h2>Communication & Training</h2>
		<p>I turn complex frameworks into clear, accessible language that sticks. Through storytelling, tailored workshops, and hands-on training, I make sure every team, from legal and HR to operations and leadership, not only understands what governance requires but knows how to apply it. And because I work with the technical tools myself, I know exactly where people get lost, and how to bring them back.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.box {
		border: 1px solid #48769e;
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background-color: var(--gray-999);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.skills {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.skills h2 {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-family: var(--font-brand);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.skills p {
		color: var(--gray-300);
		font-family: var(--font-body);
	}

	:global(.theme-dark) .skills p {
		color: #c4aaa0;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.box {
			border-radius: 1.5rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
		}

		.skills {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 5rem;
		}

		.skills h2 {
			font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		}
	}
</style>
